June 26th 1998  pilot Trevor Wright is on a routine  flight over the hot red desert of the  Australian outback he looks down to see  a strange shape carved into the ground a  huge outline of a humanoid figure it's  over two and a half miles in Lane that's  gargantuan how did it get there there is  also the question of why why would  someone want to do this the strange bird  headed carving is located near the town  of Mari three hundred and sixty miles  north of Adelaide in South Australia the  figure is the largest depiction of a  human ever created it's even visible  from space for years the mystery remains  unexplained but then rumors surface of  an Australian artist called bar Deus  Goldberg who had a crazy idea to create  an artwork visible from space fattiest  Goldberg was by all accounts quite an  eccentric man who had talked to people  about creating such a figure he was a  person who drive to to create things  that got attention I understand that he  wanted to leave his mark on the earth  but a few years after the discovery of  Mari man the artist died in strange  circumstances at the age of 61 Goldberg  died in 2002 in as unusual circumstances  as I think he lived his life and got  caught up in a bar fight and had a tooth  knocked out and that led to septicemia  Nahid he died  Goldberg never publicly admitted to any  connection to the desert carving if he  had the solution to the mystery of the  Mari men bodies Gobber took that to his  grave in August 2016 locals decided to  restore the Mari man to its full glory  but to this day the original author of  the work remains a mystery  [Music]  you
 

